- Perform Monte Carlo simulations.
- Rank surviving strategies.
- Construct diversified strategy portfolios.
- Run live-data paper trading.
- Provide comprehensive research reports.

The goal is not to maximize historical profit.

The goal is to identify strategies with repeatable statistical edges, acceptable risk and robust out-of-sample performance.

